// Per-crucible translations (overlay).
//
// CRUCIBLES (lib/crucible.ts) carry a stable numeric `id` (1..60). This
// overlay is keyed by the stringified id, then by locale. Missing fields
// fall back to the English source.
//
// The CRUCIBLE_I18N object between the BEGIN/END sentinels is GENERATED by
// scripts/translate-content.mjs (it rewrites that region in place). Don't
// hand-edit inside the sentinels. The types + the localizeCrucible helper
// below are hand-maintained.

